a Butter, Argan Oil, are just a few powerful ingredients that work in harmony to ease, soothe, moisturize ensuring a comfortable and hygienic tattooing experience. Perfect for Stencil Longevity Kamikaze ensures your stencil stays intact until the final stroke, ensuring seamless completion of your artistry. For Tattoo Professionals Endorsed by tattooers, for tattooers. Our thoughtfully curated blend minimizes pooling, client discomfort, and clogged needles, allowing you to unleash your creativity effortlessly. Capture Amazing Photos Say goodbye to swelling and redness post-session, capturing your art in its full glory. Client Comfort Use as your tattoo glide throughout the entire session for maximum client relief. Please note, this product does not provide numbing prior to linework and should not be used as such. Consult a medical professional before using products containing lidocaine. Elevate your tattooing game with Kamikaze Tattoo Artist Glide – where comfort meets creativity, every time. Disclaimer: Green soap and witch hazel both contain alcohol, which can impact the efficiency of our products when used on the same tattoo. Alcohol can interfere with the effectiveness of lidocaine, potentially reducing its full numbing power when combined with green soap or witch hazel. To ensure optimal results for both the artist and client, our products are specifically designed to work in tandem. Therefore, we recommend using Samurai Foaming Soap or distilled water instead of green soap or witch hazel, to achieve the best possible outcome. Disclaimer:This product contains both Lidocaine and CBD. While these ingredients are used topically and are not intended to produce psychoactive effects, individuals in recovery from substance use disorders should exercise caution. Lidocaine and/or CBD may potentially trigger psychological associations or cravings in some individuals. If you are in recovery, please consult with your healthcare provider before using this product. Urban’s Ed